lt.{0} m (HPow.hPow.{0, 0, 0} 2 n))","unsafe":false,"value":587,"source":{"code":"theorem size_le {m n : ℕ} : size m ≤ n ↔ m < 2 ^ n :=\n  ⟨fun h => lt_of_lt_of_le (lt_size_self _) (Nat.pow_le_pow_right (by decide) h), by\n    rw [← one_shiftLeft]\n    induction m using binaryRec generalizing n with\n    | zero => simp\n    | bit b m IH =>\n      intro h\n      by_cases e : bit b m = 0\n      · simp [e]\n      rw [size_bit e]\n      cases n with\n      | zero => exact e.elim (Nat.eq_zero_of_le_zero (le_of_lt_succ h))\n      | succ n =>\n        apply succ_le_succ (IH _)\n        apply Nat.lt_of_mul_lt_mul_left (a := 2)\n        simp only [shiftLeft_succ] at *\n        refine lt_of_le_of_lt ?_ h\n        cases b <;> dsimp [bit] <;> lia⟩","start":96,"end":113},"axioms":["Classical.choice","Quot.sound","propext"]}